    "displayName": "Campaign to reclaim XenoThreat outposts",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "Although Citizens for Prosperity is committed to change through non-violent means, it's become apparent that exceptions might have to be made. CFP safe zones near [Location] were recently and violently taken by XenoThreat forces under the command of [TargetName].\n\nWe're looking for any available combat operatives to help take these outposts back. This will undoubtedly be a difficult endeavor as XenoThreat are highly trained and eager to fight, so you should prepare accordingly.\n\nAside from clearing each cluster of XenoThreat forces, you will need to take out [TargetName], who's loss will certainly make the system safer.\n\nGood luck,\n\nLima Endicott\nLead Dispatcher\nCitizens for Prosperity",
